{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32902","headline":"和湖州杜员外冬至日白苹洲见忆 · 李郢","name":"和湖州杜员外冬至日白苹洲见忆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白苹亭上一阳生，谢朓新裁锦绣成。\n千嶂雪消溪影渌，几家梅绽海波清。\n已知鸥鸟长来狎，可许汀洲独有名。\n多媿龙门重招引，即抛田舍棹舟行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32902.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32902","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}